cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Protocol Drift Atlas, please cite the archived release."
title: "Protocol Drift Atlas"
abstract: >
  An open, provider-agnostic toolkit for measuring and reporting observed
  sensitivity in LLM safety judgments under declared changes to the
  evaluation protocol, prompt, or framing. The v0.1 release includes a
  versioned perturbation registry, a sanitized execution manifest, a
  reproducible runner, a scorer for baseline–variant agreement, an
  Exploratory Stability Card, and a counterexample log.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/cbsnet/protocol-drift-atlas"
